{"id": 107, "name": "Natan", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_4431d3412e6cff8fccc5cdf67454a08b.png", "cls": ["Marksman", ""], "specialty": ["Burst", "Magic Damage"], "difficulty": "20", "stats": ["20", "60", "20", "20"], "lanes": ["Gold Lane", ""], "story": "The savior who travels through time and space.", "skills": [{"name": "Theory of Everything", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_46d9e05fa708f5acf2026d596a406f0f.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Natan gains a stack of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Entanglement</span> each time he or his <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Reverse-Clone</span> hits an enemy with a skill (up to 6 stacks). Each stack lasts 2.5s and grants 7.5% Attack Speed and 5% Movement Speed.\nNatan's Basic Attack projectiles will return to Natan after reaching the maximum range, dealing an extra 30<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+60% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies along the way (inherits a portion of Attack Effects). Hitting an enemy refreshes <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Entanglement</span>'s duration."}, {"name": "Superposition", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_0f70bd309c626de414c448bfb83bddd6.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Natan shoots a dense mass of energy in the target direction, dealing 225<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+120% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies in its path."}, {"name": "Interference!", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6cc955ea774b6680a2868fdd186042cf.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12   Mana Cost: 60", "desc": "Natan launches a Gravitational Attractor in the target direction, dealing 150<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+60% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies in its path and knocking them back.\nThe Attractor detonates upon reaching the maximum range, dealing 30<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+10% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+12% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to nearby enemies and knocking them back."}, {"name": "Entropy?", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ec8eba4cade95718ecb5895f571a8e87.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 71, "tagname": "Summon", "tagrgb": "97,127,198"}, {"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 24   Mana Cost: 100", "desc": "Natan summons a <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Reverse-Clone</span> that lasts 10s at 6 units away. The <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Reverse-Clone</span> copies his moves and attacks in reverse and inherits 35% of his Basic Attack and skill damage.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Natan switches places with the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Reverse-Clone</span>.\n\nEach cast reduces other skills' remaining cooldowns by 50%. The <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Reverse-Clone</span> will disappear if Natan is too far away."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Swift Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b31a355cc85682eed8d9e0dc163fd756.png"}, {"name": "Feather of Heaven", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e3c784601c1f2addd276194bf0b27ebe.png"}, {"name": "Concentrated Energy", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_0bf7aa2a2ab3f03a2f8ac3b9f37dd2d1.png"}, {"name": "